SUMMARY:Dinner and Game Night at Bierhall Brewing
DESCRIPTION:Meet People Lancaster\nsat Aug 8 is dinner and game night at B
 ierhall Brewing with South Central pa SOLO Singles Group! Join us for dinn
 er at 6 with games at 7!\n​\nPlease feel free to bring your favorite gam
 e along!\n​\nGame Night @📍Bierhall Brewing\, 1703 New Holland Pike\, 
 Lancaster PA 17601\n​\nCost: Free to attend\, but please support Bierhal
 l with a drink purchase as a thanks for hosting us and please tip your bar
 tender. Please make sure you settle your tab there before leaving for the 
 night.i will have a meet people Lancaster sign up and a green flag
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/meet-people-lancaster/events/31563394
 8/
